      "text": "Eeeeeeeh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 23.6,
      "end_time": 25.0,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 29.0,
      "end_time": 32.1,
      "text": "──Hehe ♪ I finally caught you ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 32.6,
      "end_time": 34.3,
      "text": "Eris-chan?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 34.5,
      "end_time": 38.4,
      "text": "I'll tear Minerva right out of you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 39.3,
      "end_time": 41.6,
      "text": "Even if it shatters you♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 42.2,
      "end_time": 46.7,
      "text": "Minerva may be excellent, but in the end, you yourself are just..."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 47.2,
      "end_time": 49.6,
      "text": "A copy of Yui Kusano, right~?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 51.0,
      "end_time": 54.0,
      "text": "That is your greatest weakness♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 54.9,
      "end_time": 55.8,
      "text": "I see...♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 56.1,
      "end_time": 60.3,
      "text": "Your body, your magical power, and even your feelings for him──"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 60.5,
      "end_time": 62.2,
      "text": "!!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 68.5,
      "end_time": 70.0,
      "text": "Ugh...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 74.0,
      "end_time": 75.2,
      "text": "Let's do this...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 76.0,
      "end_time": 77.5,
      "text": "Ugh...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 80.6,
      "end_time": 82.3,
      "text": "Kishi-kun...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 95.4,
      "end_time": 96.6,
      "text": "Gaha!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 98.6,
      "end_time": 101.2,
      "text": "*wheeze*... *whimper*..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 103.3,
      "end_time": 108.1,
      "text": "Ahhh... I messed up... huh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 117.3,
      "end_time": 122.2,
      "text": "Well... I'll leave the rest to everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 127.9,
      "end_time": 133.1,
      "text": "(...I wonder if I was able to repay my assistant's favor...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 134.5,
      "end_time": 136.1,
      "text": "(Hehe...)"
    }
  ],
